    "text": "6 hours ago Ann Stocker, SHIIP/SMP Counselor with Monroe County Hospital & Clinics will receive a Governor’s Volunteer Award. Governor Kim Reynolds will personally announce 2026 awardees during a special recognition ceremony held on July 14 at 1 p.m. at the Urbandale High School Performing Arts Center (7111 Aurora Ave, Urbandale, IA 50322). Read full article",
